Pursuant to Regulation 33(3) of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015, we are pleased to submit herewith the following:
1. Standalone and Consolidated Un-Audited Financial Results of the Company for the Quarter/ Half Year ended on 30th September, 2026;
2. Standalone and Consolidated Limited Review Report by the Statutory Auditors of the company for the Quarter/ Half Year ended on 30th September, 2026;
3. Standalone and Consolidated Un-Audited Statement of Assets and Liabilities for the Half Year ended on 30th September, 2026; and
4. Standalone and Consolidated Un-Audited Statement of Cash Flow for the Half year ended on 30th September, 2026.
The aforesaid financial results were duly considered and approved by the Board of Directors at its meeting held on Friday, 13th November, 2026, which commenced at 3:00 P.M. and concluded at 4:30 P.M.
